      "date": "2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Gayatri Projects Limited announced that it has received INR 1.09 billion in funding from Vishwa Infrastructures and Services Pvt Ltd., Antara Asset Management Co Ltd, Zeal Global Opportunities Fund, GKC Projects Pvt Ltd. and other investors.",
      "body": "On April 20, 2626, Gayatri Projects Limited has closed and issued 109,000,000 equity shares at the price of INR 10 including premium of INR 8 for the gross proceeds of INR 1,090,000,000. The transaction involves the new investor participation of Vishwa Infrastructures and Services Pvt Ltd for 15,000,000 shares, GKC Projects Ltd for 15,000,000 shares, Antara India Evergreen Fund for 35,000,000 shares, M7 Global Fund PCC - Aerion for 5,000,000 shares, Zeal Global Opportunities Fund for 15,000,000 shares, Vivek Mundra for 14,000,000 shares, and Aniruddh Mundra for 10,000,000 shares. The transaction has been approved by board of directors, Stock exchange and Regulatory.",
