      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹115 (up from ₹0.28 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.95b (up ₹5.01b from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.6b (up ₹21.6b from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 135% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 24% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
